vrclient (VarboR's Wine OpenVR bridge, vrclient_x64.dll + vrclient_x64.so)

proton/ is imported from Valve's Proton (github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton, branch experimental_11.0, commit 7a94df4,
directory vrclient_x64/, without the openvr_* SDK header copies that only its generator reads). Those files keep their
own licenses and headers:
  - BSD 3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2015 Valve Corporation: proton/LICENSE. Covers everything in proton/ except below.
  - proton/cxx.h: GNU LGPL 2.1 or later (Wine, Copyright 2012 Piotr Caban for CodeWeavers), as stated in the file.
  - proton/json/ and proton/jsoncpp.cpp: JsonCpp, MIT or public domain, as stated in the files.
VarboR's changes to the files in proton/ are under the same license as the file they are in.

The build compiles against Wine's headers (GNU LGPL 2.1 or later), fetched at build time into build/; none are
committed here.

Everything else in this directory (src/, Makefile) is VarboR's own code:

